---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="页面未找到 — 参伍引擎"
  description="无法找到请求的参伍网站页面。"
  locale="zh-CN"
  zhPath="/"
  enPath="/en/"
>
  <section class="not-found section-wide">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> 404 · 时间线分歧</p>
    <h1>这起事件从未被记录。</h1>
    <p>页面可能已经移动，或者这条历史分支从未存在。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/">返回参伍首页</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/en/">English site</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
